### Get all characters (with stats)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/character
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get all character details (no stats)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/character/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get character by id (with stats)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/character/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get character details by id (no stats)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/character/1/details
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create a character
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/character
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Maeve",
    "maxHealth": 80,
    "level": 1
}

###

### Update a character
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/character/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Derpsi",
    "maxHealth": 100,
    "level": 2,
    "isActive": true
}

###

### Delete a character
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/character/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}